# Local Claude Code config. Scoped to the USER-OWNED paths only, never the whole `.claude/` tree:
# `basalt-ui init`/`sync` place MANAGED files at `.claude/rules/basalt-*.md` and
# `.claude/skills/basalt-*/`, and a blanket ignore would silently hide that output if this repo ever
# dogfoods its own CLI.
#
# `user-*.md` is the load-bearing entry. This is a PUBLIC repo, and those are verbatim copies of the
# machine's global CLAUDE.md — internal hostnames, the homelab/VPS layout, 1Password account names.
.claude/rules/user-*.md
.claude/rules/pandaos-config.md
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/plans/
.claude/e2e-shots/
